    nh\xE9t l\u1EA1i h\u1ED9 c\xE1i."
  satisfiedDialogues:
  - "Xong r\u1ED3i \xE0? \u0110\u1EC3 test th\u1EED xem... Ok, l\xEAn \u0111i\u1EC7n
    r\u1ED3i. Ti\u1EC1n c\xF4ng \u0111\xE2y nh\xE9 th\u1EE3!"
  unsatisfiedDialogues:
  - "Tr\u1EDDi \u01A1i, s\u1EBFp ng\xE2m \u0111\u1ED3 c\u1EE7a em l\xE2u th\u1EBF?
    \u0110ang c\u1EA7n g\u1EA5p m\xE0... Th\xF4i \u0111\u01B0a em mang ra h\xE3ng
    cho l\u1EB9."
  leavingDialogues:
  - "C\xE1i b\u1EC7nh l\u1EB7t v\u1EB7t m\xE0 ch\xE9m \u0111\u1EB9p th\u1EBF ch\xFA
